0d19a7ea07e142c60232bb54934d7b.mp4?t=1761013883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, everything is eatable - at least once!  Hold any item in your mouth for too long, and down the hatch it goes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/3bd1dd0df7626f6822781b12383f9f29.poster.avif?t=1761013883\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/3bd1dd0df7626f6822781b12383f9f29.webm?t=1761013883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/3bd1dd0df7626f6822781b12383f9f29.mp4?t=1761013883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like the garbage you keep at home, all of <strong>OUR WONDERFUL GARBAGE</strong> has a size and shape. You can put it into nice little rows, or you can just go full goblin mode. We aren't your mom - do what <i>feels right</i>, you know?</p>","developers":["RUST LTD."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/c577085ed215216e8138eaa77adeca480cd49ab6/header.jpg?t=1761013883","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 or newer</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2477750/884928451/3ed07a6e6f8728a5abba822611b1373d7a3383cc/1752277099/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752459240","